 a home office, complemented by a second full bathroom and a conveniently located upstairs laundry room. Ideally located in Davenport with convenient access to I-4 and major roadways, the property is just minutes from Publix, Posner Park, ChampionsGate, shopping, dining, entertainment, and Central Florida's world-renowned attractions, including Walt Disney World. Brentwood residents also enjoy community amenities, including a resort-style swimming pool, playground, and recreational areas. Don't miss this great opportunity to be the first to call this beautiful, brand-new property home. First come, first served!","age_restricted":false,"income_restricted":false,"flags":[],"min_rent":2195,"images":[{"url":"https://ap.rdcpix.com/ce0c5c926c1bee6e956b172a788320c4l-m1182306818r.jpg","title":null,"tags":["door","garage","house_view","porch","road","front","incomplete","exterior"],"primary":true,"origins":[{"kind":"primary"},{"kind":"listing"},{"kind":"api_gallery"}],"source_urls":["https://ap.rdcpix.com/ce0c5c926c1bee6e956b172a788320c4l-m1182306818s.jpg","https://ap.rdcpix.com/ce0c5c926c1bee6e956b172a788320c4l-m1182306818r.jpg"],"resolution_source":"API size:MAX"},{"url":"https://ap.rdcpix.com/ce0c5c926c1bee6e956b172a788320c4l-m320268846r.jpg","title":null,"tags":["garage","house_view","road","yard","complete","front","exterior"],"primary":false,"origins":[{"kind":"listing"},{"kind":"api_gallery"}],"source_urls":["https://ap.rdcpix.com/ce0c5c926c1bee6e956b172a788320c4l-m320268846s.jpg","https://ap.rdcpix.com/ce0c5c926c1bee6e956b172a788320c4l-m320268846r.jpg"],"resolution_source":"API size:MAX"},{"url":"https://ap.rdcpix.com/ce0c5c926c1bee6e956b172a788320c4l-m1227804628r.jpg","title":null,"tags":["kitchen"],"primary":false,"origins":[{"kind":"listing"},{"kind":"api_gallery"}],"source_urls":["https://ap.rdcpix.com/ce0c5c926c1bee6e956b172a788320c4l-m1227804628s.jpg","https://ap.rdcpix.com/ce0c5c926c1bee6e956b172a788320c4l-m1227804628r.jpg"],"resolution_source":"API size:MAX"}